+      <name slugifiedName="name-ii-format-specification">II. FORMAT SPECIFICATION</name>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-unnumbered-2-1">As an IP option, the contents of the first two octets are dictated by the
+IP header format to be option type and option length in octets <xref target="Postel80" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Postel 80"/>.
+The next two octets are used to control this option.</t>
+      <artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt="" pn="section-unnumbered-2-2"><![CDATA[
+     0               7               15              23              31
+     +---------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+
+     |     type      |    length     |    offset     |overflw| flags |
+     +---------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+
+     |                          internet ID                          |
+     +---------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+
+     |                          time stamp                           |
+     +---------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+
+                                     .
+                                     .
